 "remarks": "Welcome to 41 Valley Road in Cos Cob! This spacious and inviting residence features three large bedrooms, three full bathrooms, a home office, and an additional flex room with a private area-ideal for an au pair, babysitter, or guests.  The home offers a comfortable, flexible layout with beautiful hardwood floors, newer appliances, granite countertops, a wood-burning fireplace, and a washer and dryer in the unit. A private rooftop deck provides the perfect place to relax, entertain, or enjoy the outdoors.  Enjoy everything Cos Cob has to offer, with nearby parks, walking areas, local restaurants, cafes, shops, and everyday conveniences. The neighborhood is also excellent for walking, jogging, and biking. The Cos Cob Metro-North station is close by, providing an easy commute to Greenwich, Stamford, and New York City.  One-car parking is included, and small dogs are welcome. Clean, well maintained, and move-in ready, this home is available for either a short-term or annual lease.  Short-term lease options are available at a premium. Please inquire for pricing and availability.",
